{"id":"wb-6-527","name":"张溥宅第","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T12:17:40+00:00","status":"ready","title":"张溥宅第","text":"张溥宅第位于中国江苏省太仓市西门街，2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。\n\n张溥（1602～1641），明末文士，复社的主要领导人。张溥宅第由其伯父张辅之建于天启、崇祯年间。原规模较大，现存三进五开间，三进之间有复道廊连通，整座住宅连成江南民居典型的走马堂楼。这里曾作为明末学术团体复社的主要聚会场所。","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BC%A0%E6%BA%A5%E5%AE%85%E7%AC%AC","revisionId":86668341,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86668341","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/ee1adf17ca8e9954057c25b1.jpg","title":"张溥宅_“四水归堂”.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%BC%A0%E6%BA%A5%E5%AE%85_%E2%80%9C%E5%9B%9B%E6%B0%B4%E5%BD%92%E5%A0%82%E2%80%9D.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1a/%E5%BC%A0%E6%BA%A5%E5%AE%85_%E2%80%9C%E5%9B%9B%E6%B0%B4%E5%BD%92%E5%A0%82%E2%80%9D.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Cangminzho","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"rainwater can flow from the roof slopes of four directions into the courtyard","width":320,"height":213},"textScope":"body-excerpt"}